om2
note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception
fn arsstats q view ulong 8 st view ulong 7 y edit ulong 12 to ulong
put y 0 or ulong uint get q 0 shl ulong uint get q 1 32
put y 1 get q 2
v = mul get q 1 get q 2
s = mul div get q 1 128 div get q 2 128
v = add v mul s 4
put y 2 mul get q 0 v
for i ulong 7
put y add i 3 get st i
end
put y 10 get q 3
put y 11 get q 4
ret 0
end
